00:53:31.489 --> 00:53:41.305
The central lesson of the platinum rule is that there are some things that cannot be learned by verbal recounting alone, that one must experience instead.
白金法则的核心教训是，有些事情不能仅通过口头叙述来学习，而必须亲自经历。

00:53:41.305 --> 00:53:44.428
This is supported by psychology and neuroscience.
